# A round's raw output, packed by pack.mjs. A maintainer publishes it outside the tree and the
# round's raw.txt records where it can be fetched and its SHA-256 (CONTRIBUTING.md, Benchmark
# results). Only the packed archive is ignored, not a round's loose raw files before packing. The
# archives committed before this stay tracked.
/results/*/raw.tar.xz
# Private count publication stages (can remain after an abrupt stop).
/results/.count-*
